#: ../../examples.rst:380
msgid ""
"Router middleware runs before binding. Handler middleware runs after "
"binding, so it can read and replace the typed request. ``Pipe`` runs from"
" left to right. ``Handle`` ends the chain with the handler."
msgstr ""
"路由中间件在绑定之前运行。Handler 中间件在绑定之后运行，因此可以读取并替换带类型的请求。``Pipe`` "
"从左到右执行。``Handle`` 用处理器结束这条链。"

#: ../../examples.rst:421
msgid ""
"Returning from ``normalize`` without calling ``next`` skips "
"``createUser``. The returned error is handled by the router."
msgstr "``normalize`` 不调用 ``next`` 就返回时，会跳过 ``createUser``。返回的错误由路由器处理。"

